<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Carta de Amor</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sofia&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{
height:100vh;
display:flex;
flex-direction: column; /* Alinha o aviso e o envelope verticalmente */
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
background:#000;
overflow:hidden;
gap: 25px; /* Espaço entre o aviso e o envelope */
}

/* Estilização do aviso atualizada com nova fonte */
.aviso {
font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
color: #fff;
text-align: center;
max-width: 420px;
font-size: 16px;
font-weight: 400;
line-height: 1.6;
padding: 0 20px;
letter-spacing: 0.5px;
text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
animation: fadeIn 1.5s ease-in-out;
}

@keyframes fadeIn {
from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-10px); }
to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}

.envelop{
width:320px;
height:220px;
position:relative;
}

.envelop__front-paper{
position:absolute;
width:100%;
height:100%;
border-radius:12px;
border:6px solid #967b5c;
background:#ba9872;
clip-path:polygon(100% 0%,50% 70%,0% 0%,0% 100%,100% 100%);
z-index:300;
}

.envelop__back-paper{
position:absolute;
width:100%;
height:100%;
border-radius:12px;
background:#967b5c;
clip-path:polygon(0% 0%,100% 0%,90% 100%,0% 90%);
z-index:100;
}

.envelop__up-paper{
position:absolute;
width:100%;
height:100%;
border-radius:12px;
background:#967b5c;
z-index:400;
clip-path:polygon(0% 0%,100% 0%,50% 81%);
cursor: pointer;
}

.envelop__sticker{
width:100%;
height:20%;
position:absolute;
top:30%;
z-index:400;
background:#fff url("https://www.freepnglogos.com/uploads/heart-png/emoji-heart-33.png") center/40px no-repeat;
border:4px solid #e2e2e2;
cursor: pointer;
}

.envelop__false-sticker{
width:20%;
height:20%;
position:absolute;
top:30%;
left:80%;
z-index:300;
background:#fff url("https://www.freepnglogos.com/uploads/heart-png/emoji-heart-33.png") center/40px no-repeat;
border:4px solid #e2e2e2;
}

.envelop__content{
position:absolute;
width:100%;
height:100%;
z-index:200;
}

.love-notes{
width:100%;
height:100%;
display:flex;
flex-direction:column;
align-items:center;
}

.note{
width:95%;
height:30%;
background:#f9f9f9;
position:absolute;
overflow:hidden;
transition:.5s;
box-shadow:0 0 5px rgba(0,0,0,.5);
cursor: pointer;
}

.note:nth-child(1){bottom:60%;}
.note:nth-child(2){bottom:40%;}
.note:nth-child(3){bottom:20%;}

.note:hover{
height:45%;
}

.note__text{
font-family:'Sofia',cursive;
padding:15px;
}

.note__text p{
text-align:center;
font-size:15px;
margin-bottom:10px;
}

.cursor{
cursor:pointer;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="aviso">
 Hadassa, Primeiro vc clica no coração pra abrir a carta e depois clica nas folhas.
</div>

<div class="envelop">
<div class="envelop__front-paper"></div>
<div class="envelop__back-paper"></div>
<div class="envelop__up-paper js-up-paper"></div>
<div class="envelop__sticker js-sticker"></div>
<div class="envelop__false-sticker"></div>

<div class="envelop__content js-envelop-content">
<div class="love-notes">

<div class="note js-note">
<div class="note__text">
<p>Existem pessoas que passam pela nossa vida. E existem aquelas que, sem espaço algum, transformam um simples momento em uma lembrança bonita.</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="note js-note">
<div class="note__text">
  <p> Você é uma dessas raridades, Sabia? ❤️ </p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="note js-note">
<div class="note__text">
<p>Eu sei que seu coração ainda carrega marcas, por isso não peço espaço nele.
Só quero que você saiba que entre todos os sonhos que já tive, você foi o único que encontrei acordado.</p>
</div>
</div>

</div>
</div>
</div>

<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.5/gsap.min.js"></script>

<script>
const notes = document.querySelectorAll(".js-note");

function notes_ready() {
gsap.to(".js-envelop-content", {
height: "110%",
duration: 0.5
});

notes.forEach((note,index)=>{
note.addEventListener("click",function(){

notes.forEach(n=>{
n.classList.remove("active");
n.style.height="30%";
});

if(!this.classList.contains("opened")){
this.classList.add("opened");
this.style.height=(70 + index*20)+"%";
}else{
this.classList.remove("opened");
this.style.height="30%";
}
});
});
}

function set_up_paper() {
gsap.set(".js-up-paper",{
bottom:"97%",
rotation:180,
zIndex:200,
clipPath:"polygon(0% 0%,100% 0%,50% 61%)",
onComplete:notes_ready
});
}

function envelop_transition() {
gsap.to(".js-up-paper",{
bottom:"1%",
duration:0.25,
onComplete:set_up_paper
});
}

function sticker() {
gsap.set(".js-sticker",{
width:"20%",
left:"-80%"
});

document
.querySelector(".js-up-paper")
.addEventListener("click",envelop_transition);
}

document
.querySelector(".js-sticker")
.addEventListener("click",sticker);
</script>

</body>
</html>
